{1}{[You see a hunched, robed figure slowly turn to face you, and you are taken aback by his hideous appearance. An air of dank, foul evil emanates from him, warping his elven features.] Yes, yesss. You're the one, yesss? Yes. Impressive, a whole town! You see? Yesss.}{[You see a hunched, robed figure slowly turn to face you, and you are taken aback by his hideous appearance. An air of dank, foul evil emanates from him, warping his elven features.] Yes, yesss. You're the one, yesss? Yes. Impressive, a whole town! You see? Yesss.}{}{1}{}{qu1026 4 }
