{10}{Yesss. I am he. K'an Hua. The one you seek. I have been waiting, yesss? Arronax is pleased you have heeded his warning and come to our side, you see? Much you have heard about Arronax, yess? I believe it is time you heard the authentic tale.}{Yesss. I am he. K'an Hua. The one you seek. I have been waiting, yesss? Arronax is pleased you have heeded his warning and come to our side, you see? Much you have heard about Arronax, yess? I believe it is time you heard the authentic tale.}{}{2}{}{ru2112 }
