{25}{The Age of Legendsss ....  when Arronax and Nasrudin fought alongside one another to bring order to the chaos. You see? Yesss. They brought about a golden age where elves assumed their birthright, ruling all other races through the magnificent Elven Council! Gloriousss. Glorious, it was.}{The Age of Legendsss ....  when Arronax and Nasrudin fought alongside one another to bring order to the chaos. You see? Yesss. They brought about a golden age where elves assumed their birthright, ruling all other races through the magnificent Elven Council! Gloriousss. Glorious, it was.}{}{3}{}{ }
