{43}{The Void. None, save those banished, can conceive of it. Yesss? Arronax will discuss it not, saying it is not living as we know it. You see?}{The Void. None, save those banished, can conceive of it. Yesss? Arronax will discuss it not, saying it is not living as we know it. You see?}{}{5}{}{ }
