{49}{Ahh. The beauty. The simplicity of all. If one needs to find ways to weaken the wards, one takes over the order dedicated to strengthening them, yesss? Working at cross purposes is displeasing to the circular flow of energies, you see?}{Ahh. The beauty. The simplicity of all. If one needs to find ways to weaken the wards, one takes over the order dedicated to strengthening them, yesss? Working at cross purposes is displeasing to the circular flow of energies, you see?}{}{6}{}{ }
