{71}{All that is left are the wards, you see? The Ring of Brodgar is how they are called today. Weaken the wards, we must, for the return of Arronax.}{All that is left are the wards, you see? The Ring of Brodgar is how they are called today. Weaken the wards, we must, for the return of Arronax.}{}{8}{}{ss 15 }
