{85}{That is quite the provocative query, is it not? Energies are squandered in direct conflict and eyes are drawn towards it. Subterfuge and manipulation are such that the subject does not realize an attack is in the offing. Ironically, the secret of my schemes lie with Nasrudin.}{That is quite the provocative query, is it not? Energies are squandered in direct conflict and eyes are drawn towards it. Subterfuge and manipulation are such that the subject does not realize an attack is in the offing. Ironically, the secret of my schemes lie with Nasrudin.}{}{9}{}{ }
