{95}{The entire corpus of a religion can not be discarded without raising eyebrows, do you see? Slowly turned it must be. A being of "ultimate evil" is the figment of a child's dreams, is it not? Yesss. Arronax can be proven to never have existed by philosophers, left to their own devicesss.}{The entire corpus of a religion can not be discarded without raising eyebrows, do you see? Slowly turned it must be. A being of "ultimate evil" is the figment of a child's dreams, is it not? Yesss. Arronax can be proven to never have existed by philosophers, left to their own devicesss.}{}{10}{}{gf2036 1, ru2108 }
