{108}{In this realm, it is what is not being done that is of great importance. Maintained, the wards are not. You see? Maintenance slowed, than ceased. The absence of expenditure of energy. The advent of technology has, in itself, hastened the weakening, requiring even less action on our part. Gloriousss in simplicity.}{In this realm, it is what is not being done that is of great importance. Maintained, the wards are not. You see? Maintenance slowed, than ceased. The absence of expenditure of energy. The advent of technology has, in itself, hastened the weakening, requiring even less action on our part. Gloriousss in simplicity.}{}{11}{}{ru2110 }
