{151}{The Bane of Kree. Yessss. He was a noble warrior. Not afraid to do what needed to be done to show his strength. Showed no mercy to the town of Kree. Slaughtered every man, woman and child, you see? Nasrudin brought him done in single battle, he did. Gloriousss, it was. Nasrudin's reputation grew to great heights from the seed of that one battle.}{The Bane of Kree. Yessss. He was a noble warrior. Not afraid to do what needed to be done to show his strength. Showed no mercy to the town of Kree. Slaughtered every man, woman and child, you see? Nasrudin brought him done in single battle, he did. Gloriousss, it was. Nasrudin's reputation grew to great heights from the seed of that one battle.}{}{14}{}{ru2114 }
{152}{Can I ask about some of the others?}{}{5}{}{136}{ }
