{157}{One of the few human magickers supreme he was, Kerghan. Discovered the necromantic colleges. Continued to delve into the darker arts, even after the council bade him to stop. Carried out his dark experiments on live people, he did. Arronax bravely led the council to the banishment ruling for Kerghan, who went to his fate as a lamb to slaughter.}{One of the few human magickers supreme he was, Kerghan. Discovered the necromantic colleges. Continued to delve into the darker arts, even after the council bade him to stop. Carried out his dark experiments on live people, he did. Arronax bravely led the council to the banishment ruling for Kerghan, who went to his fate as a lamb to slaughter.}{}{15}{}{gf2064 1, ru2113 }
{158}{He didn't even put up a fight?}{}{5}{}{164}{ }
{159}{Can I ask about some of the others?}{}{5}{}{136}{ }
