{163}{E:}{}{5}{qa1027 1, gf2027 0}{-7}{ }
{164}{Strange, he was. His talent in researching the darker arts was unsurpassed, yet too much the coward was he to actually use his own discoveries on those that could defend themselves. Strange, as I said, yesss?}{Strange, he was. His talent in researching the darker arts was unsurpassed, yet too much the coward was he to actually use his own discoveries on those that could defend themselves. Strange, as I said, yesss?}{}{16}{}{ }
