{170}{E:}{}{5}{qu1027 0}{199}{ }
{171}{He unleashed dark tools on the world. Refused to stop his research, as I have said, you see?}{He unleashed dark tools on the world. Refused to stop his research, as I have said, you see?}{}{17}{}{ }
