{177}{Gorgoth was simply a mindless brute. Rampaging and killing to fill his bottomless hunger. Yesss. Another opportunity for the Council to prove its authority over the other races, it was. You see?}{Gorgoth was simply a mindless brute. Rampaging and killing to fill his bottomless hunger. Yesss. Another opportunity for the Council to prove its authority over the other races, it was. You see?}{}{18}{}{ru2116 }
