{199}{Ah, but you must hear of your task before you take your leave, how could it be otherwise? Perhaps you recall the heinous device constructed in Vendigroth, as I have recounted in my tale? You must retrieve and bring it to me for destruction. As long as it exists, it poses a threat to any powerful mage it might be used upon.}{Ah, but you must hear of your task before you take your leave, how could it be otherwise? Perhaps you recall the heinous device constructed in Vendigroth, as I have recounted in my tale? You must retrieve and bring it to me for destruction. As long as it exists, it poses a threat to any powerful mage it might be used upon.}{}{22}{}{qu1027 1, ss 18 }
{200}{I thought you said Vendigroth was completely destroyed.}{}{5}{ni5616}{205}{ }
{201}{How do I find this device?}{}{5}{ni5616}{210}{ }
{202}{I'm not doing any "task" for you.}{}{5}{}{303}{ }
{203}{I've already retrieved the device. [Show it to him.]}{}{5}{in 5616}{308}{ }
{204}{I've already destroyed the device.}{}{5}{gf2028 1}{310}{ }
{205}{Yesss. Believed, we did, that Vendigroth existed solely above ground. Rumors have been surfacing of vast underground corridors and labyrinths where they hid their technological horrors. No one must be allowed to posses the device, do you see? Too great is its power.}{Yesss. Believed, we did, that Vendigroth existed solely above ground. Rumors have been surfacing of vast underground corridors and labyrinths where they hid their technological horrors. No one must be allowed to posses the device, do you see? Too great is its power.}{}{23}{}{ }
{206}{How do I find this device?}{}{5}{}{210}{ }
{207}{"Corridors and labyrinths"? That sounds dodgy to me. I'll pass.}{}{5}{}{303}{ }
{209}{What does the device do, exactly?}{}{5}{}{415}{ }
{210}{The ruins are located somewhere in the Vendigroth wastes. Agents scour the vast wastes as we speak, searching for the entrance to the underground passages. Mark your map, I will, with the location of the gateway to the wastes and the base camp, yesss?}{The ruins are located somewhere in the Vendigroth wastes. Agents scour the vast wastes as we speak, searching for the entrance to the underground passages. Mark your map, I will, with the location of the gateway to the wastes and the base camp, yesss?}{}{24}{}{qu1050 1, mm 15, mm20, gf2088 1 }
{211}{But how do you know the specific device you seek still exists?}{}{5}{}{214}{ }
{214}{A description of it we have heard, spoken by one whose two eyes have seen it.}{A description of it we have heard, spoken by one whose two eyes have seen it.}{}{25}{}{ }
{215}{Why don't you have that bloke retrieve it?}{}{5}{}{220}{ }
{216}{What should I do after I retrieve the device?}{}{5}{}{225}{qu1027 2 }
{220}{Detained he is. King Praetor of Cumbria has thrown him in the pits, he has. He holds the exact location of the device. Rescue attempts have met with no success. Regrettable, it isss. If you were able to rescue him, he would be of invaluable help to you, would he not?}{Detained he is. King Praetor of Cumbria has thrown him in the pits, he has. He holds the exact location of the device. Rescue attempts have met with no success. Regrettable, it isss. If you were able to rescue him, he would be of invaluable help to you, would he not?}{}{26}{}{qu1050 1 }
{221}{I won't need his help. What should I do after I retrieve the device?}{}{5}{}{225}{qu1027 2 }
{222}{I'd best retrieve him before I go after the device, then.}{}{5}{}{317}{qu1050 2, qu1027 2 }
{225}{The Ring of Brodgar is where we shall meet when you have retrieved the device. [He begins to laugh maniacally.] Humorous, it is. Do you see?}{The Ring of Brodgar is where we shall meet when you have retrieved the device. [He begins to laugh maniacally.] Humorous, it is. Do you see?}{}{27}{}{ss 18, mm13 }
{226}{No, I don't see. What are you speaking of?}{}{5}{}{360}{ }
{231}{[He takes a long look at you, perhaps trying to decide if you are toying with him.] Disbelief fills my head. You are a complete and utter fool, yesss? Why would Arronax send you to me? [He sighs.] If this is my burden to be shouldered, so be it. What was your query?}{[He takes a long look at you, perhaps trying to decide if you are toying with him.] Disbelief fills my head. You are a complete and utter fool, yesss? Why would Arronax send you to me? [He sighs.] If this is my burden to be shouldered, so be it. What was your query?}{}{28}{}{ }
