{259}{Understanding of such a complex situation would surely elude you, would it not? I will merely say that instead of fighting a powerful enemy, we corrupted it from the inside. Do you see?}{Understanding of such a complex situation would surely elude you, would it not? I will merely say that instead of fighting a powerful enemy, we corrupted it from the inside. Do you see?}{}{33}{}{ }
