{269}{And where might my mentally impaired friend be running off to? There is work for you to do. You need to go to the Vendigroth wastes and retrieve the device. The only thing that could defeat Arronax, it is. We must possess it.}{And where might my mentally impaired friend be running off to? There is work for you to do. You need to go to the Vendigroth wastes and retrieve the device. The only thing that could defeat Arronax, it is. We must possess it.}{}{35}{}{qu1027 1, ss 18 }
