{282}{Tollo Underhill is the name he goes by, you see? He is a halfling by race, but acts somewhat like a ... murderous dwarf? Regardless, he has been thrown into the pits in Dernholm ... yes, yes, give me your map ... no one has ever made it out of the pits alive, you understand.}{Tollo Underhill is the name he goes by, you see? He is a halfling by race, but acts somewhat like a ... murderous dwarf? Regardless, he has been thrown into the pits in Dernholm ... yes, yes, give me your map ... no one has ever made it out of the pits alive, you understand.}{}{38}{}{ }
