{314}{Yesss. You shall die an agonizing death for disturbing the high priest of the Panarii!}{Yesss. You shall die an agonizing death for disturbing the high priest of the Panarii!}{}{46}{}{ }
{317}{In the pits of Dernholm, in the kingdom of Cumbria, he is kept. You see? Here it is, on your map. Killed many people there, in a fit of rage, which I believe was driven by the loss of his friends in Vendigroth. Yesss. Tollo Underhill is the name he goes by.}{In the pits of Dernholm, in the kingdom of Cumbria, he is kept. You see? Here it is, on your map. Killed many people there, in a fit of rage, which I believe was driven by the loss of his friends in Vendigroth. Yesss. Tollo Underhill is the name he goes by.}{}{47}{}{mm 5 }
