{356}{Neither here nor there, that is. Another line of questions I can answer, yesss, but I prefer to stay away from my past. Perhaps I have said too much already, you see?}{Neither here nor there, that is. Another line of questions I can answer, yesss, but I prefer to stay away from my past. Perhaps I have said too much already, you see?}{}{55}{}{ }
{357}{Why does the church still say Arronax is the ultimate evil?}{}{5}{}{95}{ }
{360}{My laughter is at myself. After a lifetime of mocking the prophecies, beginning to have my doubts, I was. It seemed the Living One was coming to destroy the church, do you see? Yesss. So, now, joined with us, you have. Obviously not the Living One. Allowed myself to be drawn in by the propaganda, I had!}{My laughter is at myself. After a lifetime of mocking the prophecies, beginning to have my doubts, I was. It seemed the Living One was coming to destroy the church, do you see? Yesss. So, now, joined with us, you have. Obviously not the Living One. Allowed myself to be drawn in by the propaganda, I had!}{}{56}{}{ }
{361}{That is rather laughable. A bit disturbing as well, I might add.}{}{5}{}{365}{ }
{362}{I've decided I am the Living One. That means I must kill you now.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 371 ,co}
{365}{Do not allow yourself to be troubled. Retrieve the device, and we shall meet upon the Black Spire, in the Ring of Brodgar, we shall. Yesss?}{Do not allow yourself to be troubled. Retrieve the device, and we shall meet upon the Black Spire, in the Ring of Brodgar, we shall. Yesss?}{}{57}{}{ss 18, mm13 }
{366}{Perhaps I should attempt to rescue the thief, after all.}{}{5}{qu1050 1, ar15}{317}{qu1050 2 }
