{370}{Until we meet at the Ring of Brodgar, then.}{}{5}{ar15}{-7}{ }
{371}{Nooo! It cannot be - You will die! I will prove the prophecies false!}{Nooo! It cannot be - You will die! I will prove the prophecies false!}{}{58}{}{ }
{373}{It is laughable, you see? After a lifetime of mocking the prophecies, beginning to have my doubts, I was. It seemed the Living One was coming to destroy the church, do you see? Yesss. So, now, joined with us, you have. Obviously not the Living One. Allowed myself to be drawn in by the propaganda, I had!}{It is laughable, you see? After a lifetime of mocking the prophecies, beginning to have my doubts, I was. It seemed the Living One was coming to destroy the church, do you see? Yesss. So, now, joined with us, you have. Obviously not the Living One. Allowed myself to be drawn in by the propaganda, I had!}{}{59}{}{ }
