{415}{Siphon away a powerful mage's life force, it does, you see? Yesss. When the regenerative shell is in place and the energies flow, it will redirect the life force flow out of the shell, destroying the mage within. This leavesss no chance for resurrection, as the mage is forever separated from thisss world.}{Siphon away a powerful mage's life force, it does, you see? Yesss. When the regenerative shell is in place and the energies flow, it will redirect the life force flow out of the shell, destroying the mage within. This leavesss no chance for resurrection, as the mage is forever separated from thisss world.}{}{67}{}{ru2118 }
{416}{How do I find this device?}{}{5}{}{210}{ }
{417}{"Corridors and labyrinths"? That sounds dodgy to me. I'll pass.}{}{5}{}{303}{ }
{425}{The ruins are located somewhere in the Vendigroth wastes. Agents scour the vast wastes as we speak, searching for the entrance to the underground passages. Mark your map, I will, with the gateway to the wastes and the location of the base camp, yesss?}{The ruins are located somewhere in the Vendigroth wastes. Agents scour the vast wastes as we speak, searching for the entrance to the underground passages. Mark your map, I will, with the gateway to the wastes and the location of the base camp, yesss?}{}{68}{}{qu1050 1, mm 15, mm20, gf2088 1 }
{426}{Perhaps I should attempt to rescue the thief, after all.}{}{5}{qu1050 1}{317}{qu1050 2 }
{427}{May I ask you some other questions before I depart?}{}{5}{}{118}{ }
{429}{Until we meet at the Ring of Brodgar, then.}{}{5}{ar15}{-7}{ }
{1533}{Arronax was the strongest of the council, you see? Strength and wisdom were his weaponsss. Envied and despised the superior elves, the people of Vendigroth did. Such was their hatred, heathen machines of technology they turned to. Arronax's pleas to their reason fell on deaf ears.}{Arronax was the strongest of the council, you see? Strength and wisdom were his weaponsss. Envied and despised the superior elves, the people of Vendigroth did. Such was their hatred, heathen machines of technology they turned to. Arronax's pleas to their reason fell on deaf ears.}{}{69}{}{ }
{1534}{[more]}{}{1}{}{1535}{ }
{1535}{They brought their destruction upon themselves by creating the Vendigroth device with which to murder Arronax himself! The response of Arronax was swift and decisive. Vendigroth was wiped from the face of Arcanum. The Council screamed in dismay at Arronax's strength of will.}{They brought their destruction upon themselves by creating the Vendigroth device with which to murder Arronax himself! The response of Arronax was swift and decisive. Vendigroth was wiped from the face of Arcanum. The Council screamed in dismay at Arronax's strength of will.}{}{70}{}{ }
{1536}{[more]}{}{1}{}{1537}{ }
{1537}{Weak minded and old, most members of the Elvin Council were by now, you see? Nasrudin's great will, shrouded by the cunning evil of the lesser races, created the opening Arronax's enemies used to strike!}{Weak minded and old, most members of the Elvin Council were by now, you see? Nasrudin's great will, shrouded by the cunning evil of the lesser races, created the opening Arronax's enemies used to strike!}{}{71}{}{ }
{1538}{[more]}{}{1}{}{1539}{ }
{1539}{Banishment was the council's sentence, when defending himself from murderous savages his only offense! Gloriousss was his response, was it not? "If I must die, I will die last!" You see? The final battle on the Black Spire took place, unleashing forces not seen before or since.}{Banishment was the council's sentence, when defending himself from murderous savages his only offense! Gloriousss was his response, was it not? "If I must die, I will die last!" You see? The final battle on the Black Spire took place, unleashing forces not seen before or since.}{}{72}{}{ }
{1540}{[more]}{}{1}{}{1541}{ }
{1541}{Such was the fury and power of the combatants that the very fabric of reality was torn asunder, you see? Failed by the weaknesss of those drawn to his side, Arronax was drawn into the Void. Yesss.}{Such was the fury and power of the combatants that the very fabric of reality was torn asunder, you see? Failed by the weaknesss of those drawn to his side, Arronax was drawn into the Void. Yesss.}{}{73}{}{ }
{1542}{[more]}{}{1}{}{1543}{ }
{1543}{All remaining energy left in the bones of the few remaining was drained to create the wards to seal the rift. Death it meant to several of them, and even the great Nasrudin was unable to regenerate his energy stores.}{All remaining energy left in the bones of the few remaining was drained to create the wards to seal the rift. Death it meant to several of them, and even the great Nasrudin was unable to regenerate his energy stores.}{}{74}{}{ }
